graph TD
    A[Start Weekly Process] --> B[Export unmatched assessments from Qualtrics]
    B --> C[Run matcher process]
    C --> D{Match found?}
    D -->|Yes| E[Qualtrics update automation]
    D -->|No| F[Flag for manual review]
    F --> G{IT Admin Review}
    G -->|Can fix| H[Manually update assessment in Qualtrics]
    G -->|Needs staff input| I[Pass to staff for Communicare update]
    I --> J[Staff updates Episode in Communicare]
    J --> K[IT Admin updates Qualtrics assessment]
    E --> L[End Weekly Process]
    H --> L
    K --> L
